<title>USA: Laguardia has 9.2 pct fall in 1996 air cargo.</title>
<headline>Laguardia has 9.2 pct fall in 1996 air cargo.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York's Laguardia Airport saw a 9.2 percent decline in air cargo imports and exports in 1996, the Port Authority of New York and New Jersey said.</p>
<p>It also had a 5.5 percent fall in mail traffic in the same period, it added.</p>
<p>1996 Cargo and Mail Traffic with percentage changes</p>
<p> AIR CARGO     1996 TONNEs	  1995    Changes</p>
<p> International     1,257	   1,738     -2.7</p>
<p> Domestic	   26,433	  28,746     -8.0</p>
<p> Total		27,690	  30,484     -9.2</p>
<p>MAIL</p>
<p> International     1,244	   2,450    -49.2</p>
<p> Domestic	   66,728	  69,478    - 4.0</p>
<p> TOTAL		67,972	  71,928    - 5.5</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542-7706 Fax+5017</p>
